#. <CLT 4>部屋で１人になったボクの頭の中では…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once I was back in my room, I got lost in thought.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>アルターエゴから聞いた情報が、
#. ぐるぐると回り続けていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What we'd learned from Alter Ego kept on spinning\n"
"around and around in my mind.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>すべてを計画した希望ヶ峰学園事務局…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The administrators of Hope's Peak had planned all of\n"
"this...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その原因を作ったのは…
#. <CLT><CLT 3>１年前の人類史上最大最悪の絶望的事件<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They did it because of \"<CLT><CLT 3>The Tragedy<CLT><CLT 4>\" which had\n"
"happened a year before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして…黒幕と思われる<CLT><CLT 3>“学園長”<CLT><CLT 4>の存在…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And apparently the <CLT><CLT 3>headmaster<CLT><CLT 4> is the one behind it\n"
"all—the mastermind.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…頭を悩ませる謎だらけ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All these mysteries make me worried.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、少しずつでも解決させていかないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I still have to try and unravel them, bit by bit.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>長い道のりだけど…やるしかないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure the road will be long, and tough, but I don't\n"
"have any other choice.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ボクがクマになる前の話をしましょう。
msgctxt "0009 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Let's talk a bit about where I was at before I became\n"
"a bear."
msgstr ""

#. 最初はね…迷ってたんだ。
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "At first, I was at a total loss."
msgstr ""

#. 自分は何になるべきか迷ってたんだ。
msgctxt "0011 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I just had no idea what I should become!"
msgstr ""

#. サポートセンターのお姉さんは、
#. エビを推してたんだよ。
msgctxt "0012 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"A lady in our tech support department suggested I try\n"
"being a shrimp. She was like..."
msgstr ""

#. 我が社が長年温めてきた最上級のアイデアですって…
#. これは破格のオファーなんですよ…だって。
msgctxt "0013 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, the company's been trying to push for this\n"
"forever! It's a really incredible offer!\""
msgstr ""

#. でもね、よくよく話を聞いてみたら…
msgctxt "0014 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But as she laid out all the details, it turned out..."
msgstr ""

#. クルマエビじゃなくて、
#. サクラエビだったんだよ！！
msgctxt "0015 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"...it wasn't a tiger prawn like I'd hoped, but a\n"
"little popcorn shrimp!"
msgstr ""

#. 小さいよ！　世界最小のマスコットだよ！
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's totally tiny! I would've been the world's\n"
"smallest mascot!"
msgstr ""

#. 食べるのはともかく、エビになるなんて嫌だよ！
#. しかも、サクラエビなんて、踏まれて終わりだし！
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I like EATING shrimp, I didn't wanna be one myself!\n"
"Plus someone might come along and step on me..."
msgstr ""

#. そうしたら、サポートセンターのお姉さんは、
#. 鼻で笑いながら言うんだ。
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So then the lady totally started laughing at me!"
msgstr ""

#. とてもじゃないですが、
#. お客様のご予算ではクルマエビは無理です…だって。
msgctxt "0019 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"She was like, \"You think we can do a tiger prawn on\n"
"*our* budget?\""
msgstr ""

#. なので、最終的にクマを選びました。
msgctxt "0020 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So ultimately, I decided to become a bear instead."
msgstr ""

#. …モノクマ誕生秘話でした。
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "And that's the secret origin story of Monokuma..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラ、おはようございます！
#. 朝です、７時になりました！　起床時間ですよ～！
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Good morning, everyone! It is now 7 a.m. and nighttime\n"
"is officially over! Time to rise and shine!"
msgstr ""

#. さぁて、今日も張り切っていきましょう～！
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Get ready to greet another beee-yutiful day!"
msgstr ""

#. まずは…食堂に行くとしよう…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"First things first, I need to head to the dining\n"
"hall..."
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0026 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0027 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
